OL,3,GNEWSAMum of disabled girl tells of
OL,4,A'fight' for childcare
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a child with a disability
OL,7,Fhas said she is struggling to find
OL,8,Fspecialised care that can meet her
OL,9,Fdaughter's needs.
OL,11,FStacey's daughter, seven-year-old
OL,12,FBailey, has Cohen syndrome, a rare
OL,13,Fgenetic condition which can cause
OL,14,Fneurodevelopmental delay and visual
OL,15,Fimpairment.
OL,17,FThe mum, from Huddersfield, said she
OL,18,Fwould like to return to work, but has
OL,19,Fyet to find anywhere in the area
OL,20,Foffering the specific type of service
OL,21,Fable to look after Bailey.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
