OL,3,GNEWSAMum of disabled girl tells of
OL,4,A'fight' for childcare
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As a parent to a disabled child, you
OL,7,Ffeel like you're fighting for their
OL,8,Feducation, the right type of care - as
OL,9,Fmuch of a normal life as possible," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
